Round 67 is done and pushed to `r2e main` (commit 392bf19). No experiment finished this round, so RESULTS.md is unchanged.

**Status (02:30 UTC)**
- **GPU:** the G1 run `r2pkfc` is in distillation at iteration 1100. It set a new best score of 1.918 at iteration 1000, and has no OOM or verification errors. Training should end around 03:55 UTC. Then `lo_pkg_r2pkfc` (the same model trained without pkg boards) runs until about 05:56. This is the order the human set, and I didn't change it.
